{"All 3D models, textures, icons, sounds and music are original and procedurally generated in the game's style: ", "Alle 3D-Modelle, Texturen, Icons, Sounds und Musik sind original und prozedural im Stil des Spiels erzeugt: "},
{"low-poly, pixelated textures, PS1-style vertex snapping and 'stepped' animation at 12 FPS (mesh flip-book).\n\n", "Low-Poly, verpixelte Texturen, Vertex-Snapping im PS1-Stil und 'Stepped'-Animation mit 12 FPS (Mesh-Flipbook).\n\n"},
